---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="Cloudy Pool Water in Spring, TX | Causes & Fixes" description="Cloudy pool water solutions in Spring, TX. Filtration, chemistry, and professional clearing for crystal-clear results.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Cloudy Water</h1><p>Restore clarity fast with the right diagnosis and treatment.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>Cloudy water is usually caused by poor filtration, imbalanced chemistry, or fine particles that the filter cannot catch. In Spring’s heat and pollen season it can appear quickly.</p>
    <h2>Common Causes</h2>
    <ul><li>Low or high pH and alkalinity</li><li>Insufficient free chlorine</li><li>Dirty or undersized filter</li><li>Algae starting to form</li><li>High total dissolved solids or phosphates</li></ul>
    <h2>How We Fix It</h2>
    <p>We test thoroughly, adjust chemistry, clean or backwash the filter, and use clarifiers or floc when appropriate. Most mild cases clear within a day or two of proper treatment.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get Clear Water Again</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
